":"section","heading":"Inline Markup","level":1,"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is emphasized, and so is this."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strong, and so is this."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"An emphasized link."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strong and em."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"So is this word."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strong and em."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"So is this word."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is code: >, $, \, \$, <html>."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"More code: Class and Type"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Referencing a man page: nix.conf(5)"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strikeout."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Superscripts: abcd ahello ahello there."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Subscripts: H2O, H23O, Hmany of themO."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"These should not be superscripts or subscripts, because of the unescaped spaces: a^b c^d, a~b c~d."}]},{"type":"section","heading":"Smart quotes, ellipses, dashes","level":1,"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"“Hello,” said the spider. “‘Shelob’ is my name.”"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“A”, “B”, and “C” are letters."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“He said, ‘I want to go.’” Were you alive in the 70’s?"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Some dashes: one—two — three—four — five."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Dashes between numbers: 5–7, 255–66, 1987–1999."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ellipses…and…and…."},{"type":"code","text":"e = mc^{2}","language":"math"},{"type":"code","text":"1","language":"math"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"$e = mc^{2}$"},{"type":"code","text":"e = mc^{2}","language":"math"}]},{"type":"section","heading":"Special Characters","level":1,"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here is some unicode:"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":["I hat: Î","o umlaut: ö","section: §","set membership: ∈","copyright: ©"]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AT&T has an ampersand in their name."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AT&T is another way to write i