raph","text":"Here’s a link with an ampersand in the URL."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here’s a link with an amersand in the link text: AT&T."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here’s an inline link."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here’s an inline link in pointy braces."}]},{"type":"section","heading":"Autolinks","level":2,"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"With an ampersand: http://example.com/?foo=1&bar=2"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":["In a list?","http://example.com/","It should."]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"An e-mail address: nobody@nowhere.net"},{"type":"blockquote","body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blockquoted: http://example.com/"}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Auto-links should not occur here: <http://example.com/>"},{"type":"code","text":"or here: <http://example.com/>"}]}]},{"type":"section","heading":"Images","level":1,"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"From “Voyage dans la Lune” by Georges Melies (1902):"},{"type":"image"},{"type":"image"},{"type":"image"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here is a movie  icon. And here a second movie  icon. And here a third movie  icon."},{"type":"image"}]},{"type":"section","heading":"Footnotes","level":1,"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here is a footnote reference, and another. This should not be a footnote reference, because it contains a space.[^my note] Here is an inline note."},{"type":"blockquote","body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Notes can go in quotes."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":["And in list items."]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This paragraph should not be part of the note, as it is not indented."}]},{"type":"section","heading":"Tables","level":1,"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Simple table with caption:"},{"type":"table","headers":["Right","Left","Center","Default"],"rows":[["12","12","12","12"],["123","123","123","123"],["1","1","1","1"]]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Demonstration of simple table syntax."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Simple table without caption:"},{"type":"